# Project Name: Project Demonstration Phase

## Project Title
Implement Client Script & UI Policy - Incident

## Project Demonstration

The project demonstrates the implementation of Client Script
and UI Policy in the ServiceNow Incident form.

## Client Script Code

```javascript
function onLoad() {

    // Make Short Description mandatory
    g_form.setMandatory('short_description', true);

    // Assignment fields are initially optional
    g_form.setMandatory('assignment_group', false);
    g_form.setMandatory('assigned_to', false);
}

function onChange(control, oldValue, newValue, isLoading) {

    if (isLoading) {
        return;
    }

    // Priority 1 - Critical
    if (newValue == '1') {

        g_form.setMandatory('assignment_group', true);
        g_form.setMandatory('assigned_to', true);

        g_form.setVisible('assignment_group', true);
        g_form.setVisible('assigned_to', true);

    } else {

        g_form.setMandatory('assignment_group', false);
        g_form.setMandatory('assigned_to', false);
    }
}
